{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 47","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1:Similarity\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1:Similarity</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:_Area\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2: Area</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle inscribed in a triangle has its base coinciding with the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> of the triangle. If the altitude of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, and the altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of the rectangle is half the base of the rectangle, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7a4634a9badeda7eb6db69ee121ae3602382b9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x=\\dfrac{1}{2}h \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x=\\dfrac{bh}{b+h} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x=\\dfrac{bh}{2h+b} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{hb}{2}} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ x=\\dfrac{1}{2}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"659\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:Similarity\">Solution 1:Similarity</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1:Similarity\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw the triangle.The small triangle formed by taking away the rectangle and the two small portions left is similar to the big triangle.Hence, the proportions of the heights is equal to the proportions of the sides. \n</p><p>In particular, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8e162c19ea6bac23c6f451167fd3f793d733d5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{2x}{b} = \\dfrac{h - x}{h} \\implies 2xh = bh - bx \\implies (2h + b)x = bh \\implies x = \\dfrac{bh}{2h + b}\\]\" width=\"541\" height=\"39\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:_Area\">Solution 2: Area</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2: Area\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smaller triangle at the top has an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/8419f30afd399d191c951af0165adb58b840dddb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{2x(h-x)}{2}=x(h-x)\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Because the two other pieces are complementary triangles, we can add them together to create one triangle with area\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c945d99f919f2095d7c854b55261e95ba7e5fb6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{x(b-2x)}{2}\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Lastly the area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e925b5ee6f8cdc34846ffbd49efddf1932956fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2$\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. These areas together sum to the area of the big rectangle, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b6307ff64422561a99073e11bf62f56318b035a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{bh}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />. Hence,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/3/b5348901dcab65f0ccb52a2af4160c292011fe6a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{bh}{2}=2x^2 + \\dfrac{x(b-2x)}{2}+x(h-x)\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Solving we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f89677f637c88dad05fc1ac35fd7d49b34134bc4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\dfrac{bh}{2h + b}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"39\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=169s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=169s</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">Problem 46</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></